he gate fit a 43 GB disk — see `AGENTS.md` § Gate on target directories.\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:declared-configuration-invariants"},{"serves":"vision:O6"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"synth-check fails in any worktree on go build VCS status; a background wrapper reports exit 0 for a gate that exited 201; protocol-cli has no lib target.","tags":["gate"],"title":"Every gate step runs in a fresh worktree, and a wrapper's exit is never read as the gate's"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG0cc506f4dca6cc90b0af7a2a6f60907ee4da26866ddd8d3116f85d0749f32a42","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":5,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG0cc506f4dca6cc90b0af7a2a6f60907ee4da26866ddd8d3116f85d0749f32a42"]}]